알갱이가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":272.02,"end":279.12,"text":"誰も居ないシートにこぼれた","translation":"아무도 없는 자리에 쏟아졌어","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}